nderline" href="/about"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">About</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Our mission</span></a><a class="block px-4 py-2.5 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors no-underline" href="/editorial-standards"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">Editorial Standards</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Sourcing &amp; corrections</span></a><a class="block px-4 py-2.5 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors no-underline" href="/data"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">Data &amp; API</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Downloads &amp; API access</span></a></div></div></div><a class="bg-blue-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-800 transition-colors no-underline" href="/contact">Contact Us</a></div><button type="button" class="md:hidden p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-menu"><svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main id="main-content" data-rum-id="site-main" class="flex-1"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://locatetrump.com/schedule#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this the official White House schedule?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. This page is compiled from publicly reported movement events detected by our automated news-monitoring pipeline and corroborated across independent outlets. It is an unofficial tracker with no connection to the White House or any government scheduling office, and it will not include unannounced or unreported travel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What time of day does the schedule update?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no fixed publishing hour. Ingestion jobs check source feeds around the clock, roughly every five minutes, so newly confirmed movements can appear at any time of day or night. The stamp at the top of this page shows when the current version was last generated, in Eastern Time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does the confidence score mean?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Each entry carries a confidence score that reflects how strongly independent sources agreed on the reported movement when it was detected. Scores also decay as hours pass without re-confirmation, so a fresh, well-corroborated entry scores higher than an aging one that no outlet has re-confirmed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I see where Trump is right now?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The live map on the LocateTrump home page shows the most recently confirmed location with real-time confidence context. This schedule page is the day-by-day movement view; the home page is the best place to check the current position at a glance."}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://locatetrump.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Schedule","item":"https://locatetrump.com/schedule"}]}</script><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 sm:py-10 space-y-6 sm:space-y-8"><section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/60"><h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Trump&#x27;s Schedule Today</h1><p class="mt-2 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600">A day-by-day timeline of confirmed, publicly reported presidential movements. Last updated<!-- --> <!-- -->6:30 PM<!-- --> ET — <!-- -->October 1, 2026<!-- -->.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">Every entry below was verified by our automated pipeline against multiple independent news sources before publication. This is an unofficial tracker built from public reporting, not the official White House schedule. Times are shown in Eastern Time and reflect when each movement was confirmed.</p><div class="mt-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 hover:bg-blue-800 transition-colors no-underline" href="/">See where Trump is right now on the live map →</a></div></section><section class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/60 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Today&#x27;s Confirmed Movements</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">Movement events confirmed so far today (<!-- -->October 1, 2026<!-- -->), listed chronologically in Eastern Time.</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-slate-200/60 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400"><th scope="col" class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Time (ET)</th><th scope="col" class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Venue</th><th scope="col" class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">City / State</th><th scope="col" class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Event Type</th><th scope="col" class="py-2 font-semibold">Confidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-slate-100 last:border-b-0 align-top"><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-slate-700">3:00 PM</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-semibold text-slate-800">Dallas</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-slate-600 whitespace-nowrap">Dallas<!-- -->, <!-- -->Texas</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-blue-700 font-medium">Travel</td><td class="py-2.5"><span class="inline-block text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">92<!-- -->%</span></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100 last:border-b-0 align-top"><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-slate-700">3:30 PM</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-slate-600 whitespace-nowrap">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</td><td class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-blue-700 font-medium">Official Business</td><td class="py-2.5"><span class="inline-block text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">100<!-- -->%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><aside aria-label="Advertisement" data-rum-id="ad-in-content" class="ad-slot w-full  "><div class="mx-auto flex h-[250px] w-[300px] max-w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden lg:h-[90px] lg:w-[728px] "></div></aside><section class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/60 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Previous 7 Days</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">Confirmed movements from the past week, grouped by Eastern Time calendar day, newest day first.</p><div class="space-y-5"><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-1.5 mb-2">Tuesday, September 29, 2026</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">8:50 AM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</span><span class="text-slate-500">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Residence</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">100<!-- -->%</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-1.5 mb-2">Sunday, September 27, 2026</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">10:15 AM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Chicago</span><span class="text-slate-500">Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->Illinois</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Travel</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">92<!-- -->%</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">4:45 PM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</span><span class="text-slate-500">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Official Business</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">100<!-- -->%</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-1.5 mb-2">Saturday, September 26, 2026</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">5:05 AM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</span><span class="text-slate-500">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Public Appearance</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">80<!-- -->%</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">11:50 AM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</span><span class="text-slate-500">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Public Appearance</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">100<!-- -->%</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-1.5 mb-2">Thursday, September 24, 2026</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">4:05 PM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</span><span class="text-slate-500">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Public Appearance</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">80<!-- -->%</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">6:05 PM<!-- --> ET</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">White House</span><span class="text-slate-500">Washington<!-- -->, <!-- -->D.C.</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Public Appearance</span><span class="ml-auto text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">80<!-- -->%</span></li></ul></div></div></section><aside aria-label="Advertisement" data-rum-id="ad-native-inline" class="ad-slot hidden w-full lg:block  "><div class="mx-auto min-h-[300px] w-full max-w-[960px] "><div id="container-a25b76ef17b4c7ef42d47fed409c11d8"></div></div></aside><section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/60"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">How This Schedule Is Compiled</h2><div class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-3"><p>LocateTrump does not receive a private schedule feed. Automated monitoring jobs check RSS and news feeds from more than ten major outlets every five minutes, extract place references from new reporting, and map those references against a database of known tracked locations. Before any movement appears on this page, the pipeline requires corroboration from independent sources, and each published entry carries a confidence score that decays over time until fresh coverage re-confirms it.</p><p>This page therefore reflects publicly reported, confirmed movements — it is not the official White House schedule, and it will not show unannounced or unreported travel. Times indicate when each event was confirmed by the pipeline, in Eastern Time, not necessarily when the event began.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Schedule FAQ</h2><div class="space-y-3"><details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/60 overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 pr-4">Is this the official White House schedule?</h3><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">No. This page is compiled from publicly reported movement events detected by our automated news-monitoring pipeline and corroborated across independent outlets. It is an unofficial tracker with no connection to the White House or any government scheduling office, and it will not include unannounced or unreported travel.</p></div></details><details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/60 overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 pr-4">What time of day does the schedule update?</h3><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">There is no fixed publishing hour. Ingestion jobs check source feeds around the clock, roughly every five minutes, so newly confirmed movements can appear at any time of day or night. The stamp at the top of this page shows when the current version was last generated, in Eastern Time.</p></div></details><details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/60 overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 pr-4">What does the confidence score mean?</h3><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Each entry carries a confidence score that reflects how strongly independent sources agreed on the reported movement when it was detected. Scores also decay as hours pass without re-confirmation, so a fresh, well-corroborated entry scores higher than an aging one that no outlet has re-confirmed.</p></div></details><details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/60 overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 pr-4">Where can I see where Trump is right now?</h3><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The live map on the LocateTrump home page shows the most recently confirmed location with real-time confidence context. This schedule page is the day-by-day movement view; the home page is the best place to check the current position at a glance.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-medium text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-800 no-underline mt-2" href="/">Open the live map →</a></div></details></div></section><section class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/60 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Keep Researching</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">Move from today&#x27;s timeline into the current position, the deeper archive, and pattern-level views.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><a class="no-underline rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 p-4 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" href="/"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">Live map<!-- --> →</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">The current confirmed position with real-time confidence context.</span></a><a class="no-underline rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 p-4 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" href="/history"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">Location history<!-- --> →</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">The full event-level chronology beyond the last seven days.</span></a><a class="no-underline rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 p-4 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" href="/news"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">News feed<!-- --> →</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">The update stream behind each confirmed movement entry.</span></a><a class="no-underline rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 p-4 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" href="/states"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">State profiles<!-- --> →</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">State-by-state visit patterns and tracked venues.</span></a><a class="no-underline rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 p-4 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" href="/locations"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">Location profiles<!-- --> →</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Individual venue pages with visit records and context.</span></a><a class="no-underline rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 p-4 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors" href="/summaries"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">Weekly summaries<!-- --> →</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Auto-generated weekly travel recaps and distance totals.</span></a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer data-rum-id="site-footer" class="bg-slate-50/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-t border-slate-200/80 mt-12"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div><div class="mb-3"><img alt="Locate Trump" loading="lazy" width="160" height="42" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-9 w-auto" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flocate-trump-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_FR4ub8j85ueFiYfuWQWa8pj28Roa 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flocate-trump-logo.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_FR4ub8j85ueFiYfuWQWa8pj28Roa 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flocate-trump-logo.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_FR4ub8j85ueFiYfuWQWa8pj28Roa"/></div><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Real-time tracking of presidential activities based on publicly available news sources and officia