oday's confirmed Trump movements with times in ET, venues, and event types, verified against multiple news sources and refreshed every five minutes.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://locatetrump.com/schedule\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:site_name\",\"content\":\"LocateTrump\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://locatetrump.com/api/og?type=page\u0026title=Trump%27s+Schedule+Today\u0026subtitle=Confirmed+Daily+Movements\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:image:width\",\"content\":\"1200\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:image:height\",\"content\":\"630\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Trump's Schedule Today - LocateTrump\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"website\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Trump's Schedule Today - Live Timeline \u0026 Movements\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Today's confirmed Trump movements with times in ET, venues, and event types, verified against multiple news sources and refreshed every five minutes.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://locatetrump.com/api/og?type=page\u0026title=Trump%27s+Schedule+Today\u0026subtitle=Confirmed+Daily+Movements\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/images/app-icon-512.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/images/app-icon-180.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L24\",\"21\",{}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"25:T6c0,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://locatetrump.com/schedule#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this the official White House schedule?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. This page is compiled from publicly reported movement events detected by our automated news-monitoring pipeline and corroborated across independent outlets. It is an unofficial tracker with no connection to the White House or any government scheduling office, and it will not include unannounced or unreported travel.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What time of day does the schedule update?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"There is no fixed publishing hour. Ingestion jobs check source feeds around the clock, roughly every five minutes, so newly confirmed movements can appear at any time of day or night. The stamp at the top of this page shows when the current version was last generated, in Eastern Time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the confidence score mean?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Each entry carries a confidence score that reflects how strongly independent sources agreed on the reported movement when it was detected. Scores also decay as hours pass without re-confirmation, so a fresh, well-corroborated entry scores higher than an aging one that no outlet has re-confirmed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I see where Trump is right now?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The live map on the LocateTrump home page shows the most recently confirmed location with real-time confidence context. This schedule page is the day-by-day movement view; the home page is the best place to check the current position at a glance.\"}}]}18:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$25\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://locatetrump.com\\\"},{\\\"@